2026-07-27T11:47:18.5561334Z i /tmp/RtmpT8TQwv/duckdb
2026-07-27T11:47:18.5561789Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T11:47:18.5562311Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T11:47:18.5563201Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T11:47:18.5563965Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T11:47:18.5565053Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T11:47:18.5566196Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
